# Today's Brief Page — Production Handoff

**Route:** `/` (default) and `/brief`  
**Page file:** `frontend/src/pages/TodaysBrief.tsx`  
**Last updated:** 2026-05-23

---

## Component Hierarchy (top to bottom)

```
TodaysBrief (orchestrator — fetches all data, passes typed props)
├── market-open-banner          — redirects to /live when market is open
├── VerdictBanner               — giant color-coded verdict (morning brief)
├── KC Reconciliation Note      — amber banner when morning brief ≠ live KC
├── MasterBriefPanels
│   ├── ExploitationCommandCenter  — live kill chain verdict + action plan drawer
│   └── MacroEdgeStrip             — regime, next event, ADP/GDP, Fed path
├── ThesisBar                   — SPY position vs wall in plain English
├── SignalPills                 — bullish/bearish signal breakdown
├── Approved Tickers            — green TickerCard grid
├── Blocked Tickers             — red TickerCard grid
├── DataWarnings                — yellow banner for volume anomalies
├── Volume Profile row          — suppressed if data_error
├── IndexStrip                  — SPY/QQQ/IWM with DP sparklines
└── GateHealthBar               — win rate, blocked/allowed, avg R
```

