## API Endpoints Used

| Endpoint | Interval | Purpose |
|----------|----------|---------|
| `GET /morning-brief` | 60s (market hours only) | Main brief data |
| `GET /kill-shots-live` | once on mount | KC reconciliation verdict |
| `GET /api/v1/gate/health?n=20` | once on mount | Gate health stats |
| `GET /api/v1/intraday/snapshot` | once on mount | Market open check |
| `GET /data/gate_signals_today.json` | once (after brief loads) | Confidence scores |
| `GET /api/v1/ta/{sym}/consensus` | once per ticker | TA consensus |
| `GET /api/v1/axlfi/clusters?universe=sp500` | once | Forward returns |
| `GET /brief/master` | 120s (MacroEdgeStrip) | Macro edge data |
| `GET /kill-shots-live` | 30s (ExploitationCommandCenter) | Live KC verdict |

**Base URLs:**
```ts
const MONITOR_URL = VITE_API_URL.replace('/api/v1', '');  // morning-brief lives here
const API_URL = VITE_API_URL;                              // /api/v1/... endpoints
const API_BASE = VITE_API_URL.replace('/api/v1', '');      // /kill-shots-live lives here
```

