## Verdict Vocabulary Mapping

The morning brief uses one vocabulary; the kill chain uses another. Both are now handled by `VerdictBanner`.

| Morning Brief | Kill Chain | Meaning |
|---------------|------------|---------|
| STRONG_BUY | BOOST | All layers aligned, deploy capital |
| BUY | BUY | Edge present, trade approved names |
| NEUTRAL | NEUTRAL / HOLD | No clear edge |
| CAUTION | WATCH | Mixed signals, reduce size |
| SELL | HARD_VETO / WAR_VETO | Risk off, no new longs |
| — | SOFT_VETO | One layer red, reduce size |

`VerdictBanner` handles all 11 vocabulary items. If a new verdict is added to the kill chain, add it to `VERDICT_STYLES` in `VerdictBanner.tsx`.

