## KC Reconciliation Note

Shown when `kcVerdict !== null && kcVerdict !== brief.verdict`.

```tsx
const showKcReconciliation = kcVerdict !== null && kcVerdict !== brief.verdict;
```

Amber banner with link to `/signal-chain`. Fetches `/kill-shots-live` once on mount (not polled — brief page doesn't need live KC updates, only the note).

