## ExploitationCommandCenter — Action Plan Drawer

Click "Action Plan" button to expand entry/invalidation/window from `/kill-shots-live`.

Fields: `data.action_plan.position`, `.entry_trigger`, `.invalidation`, `.time_window`

If `action_plan` is null (backend didn't compute it), the button is hidden.

---

## MacroEdgeStrip — Data Contract

Fetches `GET /brief/master` every 120s via `useMasterBrief(120_000)` hook.

Fields used:
- `data.macro_regime.regime` — RISK_ON / RISK_OFF / NEUTRAL
- `data.economic_veto.next_event` — next high-impact event name
- `data.economic_veto.hours_away` — hours until event
- `data.economic_veto.confidence_cap` — max confidence during veto window
- `data.fed_intelligence.rate_path.next_meeting` — next FOMC date
- `data.fed_intelligence.rate_path.may_p_cut` — probability of cut
- `data.adp_prediction` — ADP signal
- `data.gdp_nowcast` — GDP nowcast signal

---

## TickerCard Enrichment

Each `TickerCard` receives optional enrichment from TodaysBrief:
- `confidence` — from `gate_signals_today.json` (gate signal confidence score)
- `taConsensus` — from `/api/v1/ta/{sym}/consensus`
- `forwardReturn5d` — from `/api/v1/axlfi/clusters?universe=sp500`

These are fetched in parallel after `brief` loads. Failures are silent (undefined props).

